{"slug": "repo-master-readmemd", "id": "repo-master-readmemd#b0000", "block": 0, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 53, "sha256": "3297ac8a6a15c553", "text": "Assignments for CS146S: The Modern Software Developer"}
{"slug": "repo-master-readmemd", "id": "repo-master-readmemd#b0001", "block": 1, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 152, "sha256": "cad71e13977709d4", "text": "This is the home of the assignments for [CS146S: The Modern Software Developer](https://themodernsoftware.dev), taught at Stanford University fall 2026."}
{"slug": "repo-master-readmemd", "id": "repo-master-readmemd#b0002", "block": 2, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 10, "sha256": "2978f73fc46f1a28", "text": "Repo Setup"}
{"slug": "repo-master-readmemd", "id": "repo-master-readmemd#b0003", "block": 3, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 34, "sha256": "74eae5417c7e700c", "text": "These steps work with Python 3.12."}
{"slug": "repo-master-readmemd", "id": "repo-master-readmemd#b0004-i00", "block": 4, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 16, "sha256": "9086eb9790a7bb0b", "text": "Install Anaconda"}
{"slug": "repo-master-readmemd", "id": "repo-master-readmemd#b0004-i01", "block": 4, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 86, "sha256": "575b166f323eb6f5", "text": "Download and install: [Anaconda Individual Edition](https://www.anaconda.com/download)"}
{"slug": "repo-master-readmemd", "id": "repo-master-readmemd#b0004-i02", "block": 4, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 49, "sha256": "372edfc4ec4f7c7c", "text": "Open a new terminal so `conda` is on your `PATH`."}
{"slug": "repo-master-readmemd", "id": "repo-master-readmemd#b0005-i00", "block": 5, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 125, "sha256": "05c48b99a19c6f73", "text": "Create and activate a Conda environment (Python 3.12) ```bash conda create -n cs146s python=3.12 -y conda activate cs146s ```"}
{"slug": "repo-master-readmemd", "id": "repo-master-readmemd#b0006-i00", "block": 6, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 81, "sha256": "4182eb256e30de89", "text": "Install Poetry ```bash curl -sSL https://install.python-poetry.org | python - ```"}
{"slug": "repo-master-readmemd", "id": "repo-master-readmemd#b0007-i00", "block": 7, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 143, "sha256": "3100bc085445ef5b", "text": "Install project dependencies with Poetry (inside the activated Conda env) From the repository root: ```bash poetry install --no-interaction ```"}
